ALSO ON THIS DECTAPE IS A PROGRAM (BLDMST) TO BUILD AN OS/8
DECTAPE SYSTEM WHICH CAN USE THE TELETYPE FOR PAPER TAPE INPUT
AND OUTPUT. THE TAPE READER IS DEVICE 'PTR:' AND THE PUNCH IS
'PTP:'. WHEN THE PAPER TAPE READER IS REQUESTED, IT WILL FIRST
TYPE AN UPARROW AND WAIT FOR YOU TO LOAD THE TAPE. AFTER THE TAPE
IS READY, ENTER ANY CHARACTER AND START THE READER. WHEN THE PUNCH
IS REQUESTED, IT WILL FIRST HALT THE COMPUTER TO ALLOW YOU TO
START THE PUNCH, THEN HIT CONTINUE. THE PAPER TAPE HANDLER
(PT33B.PA) IS ALSO INCLUDED ON THE DECTAPE.

THIS VERSION OF OS/8 AND MAST WILL USE DATES AFTER 1977 CORRECTLY.

GIVE ME A CALL IF YOU HAVE ANY PROBLEMS WITH THIS NEW SOFTWARE.


			SINCERELY,

			LEE NICHOLS


